    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "It is very important to work in the category of compactly supported currents for the pushforward by an orthogonal projection to make sense. Indeed, one can only push forward a noncompactly supported current by a proper map, which orthogonal projections are not; moreover, it does not really make sense to make sense to push forward a submanifold of Rn."
